        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Waawutmoó Ashuru i didií dirii' dinkwa nee mukós kudá' sleémeero taa tsuú/ baraá slaqwarár wa alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Aantuuín kaa baráy foola hhe'eés baraá bohongwduú gi'iwo. /Aantaá slaqwaruuseerós tidá' sleémeero taa tsuú/ baraá slaqwarár wa ale, inós ngwaa harweeriyé'. Qoomár inooín iwa slafiya', muu nguna daandeemo feehhamiisiyé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Waawutmoó Elamu sleeme i baraadá', kwaa harweér nee /aantaá slaqwaruuseerós tidá' taa tsuú/ baraá slaqwarár wa ale. Kudá' sleémeero taa hheehhe'eesiiká nina /eetiyé' baraá gi'ií alé. Qoomár iwa slafiya' muu nguna daandeemo feehhamiisiyé'. Ala hám daxta ta murer'ín loohiis dinkwa nee mukdá' /e/etiím baraá bohóngw gi'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmoó Elamu kwaa qaás dinkwa nee slaqwaruuseerós tidá' taa tsuú/ baraá slaqwarár wa alé. Inós kwaa harweér nee /aantaá slaqwaruuseerós tidá' taa tsuú/ baraá slaqwarár wa alé, nee kudá' sleémeero taa hheehhe'eesiiká. Qoomár iwa slafiya' muu nguna daandeemo feehhamiisiyé', nee hám daxta ta diirí, ki mureekeemiis dinkwa nee mukdá' taa tsuú/ baraá slaqwarár wa alé.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
