            "sid": "EZK 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Waawituú Mesheki nee Tubali i baraadá' i diri'iyá' dinkwa nee muk'ín sleémeero, kaa harweér nee /aantaá slaqwaruuser'ín. Mukwí sleémeero taa hheehhe'eemisiiká, kuna tsuú/ baraá slaqwarár wa alé. Mukwí qoomár iwa slafi muu nguna daandeemo feehhamiisiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí kwa dinkwaárií fooliiká nee pihhuuseedár aáng, tidá' aa baraá gi'ií /et nee xooslar'ín ar slaqwaraaro, paangaduuín nga sager'ín i qaasiyé', nee gaambuín i gawaá slaqooín. Pihhuuseerí qoomár iwa slaf muu nguna daandeemo feehhamiisiyé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
